##OpenGL GLIB
Perspective 70
LookAt  0 0 3  0 0 0  0 1 0

Vertex   snake.vert
Fragment snake.frag
Program  SnakeH  			\
		uUseST <true>		\
		uX <-5. 0. 5.>		\
		uDx <0. 3. 5.>		\
		uY <-5. 0. 5.>		\
		uDy <0. 3. 5.>		\
		uZ <-5. 0. 5.>		\
		uDz <0. 3. 5.>      \
		amplitude <0. .5 5.>\

Color 1. 1. 1.

Obj snakeH.obj 1.0 1 1